    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but self care doesn't change the fact that i'm the problem. it's just a temporary fix. eventually i'll just start draining them again. it feels selfish to keep dragging them through this. if i just stopped being a factor in their lives, they wouldn't have to deal with my darkness anymore. wouldn't it actually be more selfless to just... let them go? to let them be free of me?",
