      "content": "The idea of self-sacrifice to protect others is a deeply ingrained, yet destructive, pattern of thinking. You are framing your existence as a problem that needs to be eliminated for their benefit, which is an unfair burden to place on yourself. True selflessness isn't about disappearing; it's about finding the strength to be a healthier part of your own life. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these overwhelming feelings of worthlessness.",
